{"id":"2c6d989a7d314654","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-classical-expansion-semantics.md","title":"扩充公式到基本语法的语义保持","display":"lem-classical-expansion-semantics — 扩充公式到基本语法的语义保持","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-classical-expansion-semantics","aliases":["72-lem-classical-expansion-semantics"],"display":"lem-classical-expansion-semantics — 扩充公式到基本语法的语义保持","depends_on":["[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.1, print26–28/PDF38–40; local check of the existing expansion e","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-classical-expansion-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-classical-expansion-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-classical-expansion-semantics — 扩充公式到基本语法的语义保持"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.1, print26–28/PDF38–40; local check of the existing expansion e"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:X_\\Sigma\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(e:X_\\Sigma\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 的展开函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in|\\mathfrak M|^V\">\\(s\\in|\\mathfrak M|^V\\)</span>，求值取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in X_\\Sigma\">\\(A\\in X_\\Sigma\\)</span>；基本公式使用扩充求值的限制。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(e(A))=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(e(A))=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Valid}(e(A))\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Valid}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Valid}(e(A))\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Valid}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对公式归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land,\\to,\\exists\">\\(\\land,\\to,\\exists\\)</span> 的展开分别按经典De Morgan、蕴涵真值表、量词对偶验证；其他构造保持。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e(\\top)=\\forall v_0(v_0\\doteq v_0)\">\\(e(\\top)=\\forall v_0(v_0\\doteq v_0)\\)</span> 在身份等式解释下为真，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e(\\bot)\">\\(e(\\bot)\\)</span> 为其否定。这里身份等式解释是上游结构定义的条件，不能把本引理直接移到没有等号公理的纯句法推导等价上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e:X_\\Sigma\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$ 是 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 的展开函数；$\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)$、$s\\in|\\mathfrak M|^V$，求值取 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e:X_\\Sigma\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$ 是 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 的展开函数；$\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)$、$s\\in|\\mathfrak M|^V$，求值取 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"e:X_\\Sigma\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in|\\mathfrak M|^V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(e(A))=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Valid}(e(A))\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Valid}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\land,\\to,\\exists","display":false},{"tex":"e(\\top)=\\forall v_0(v_0\\doteq v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"e(\\bot)","display":false}],"bytes":1690,"backlinks":[{"id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"2026-10-22：原子与真假常元上的自由代入条件统一写为元理论恒真式 $0=0$，以免将已经编码为语法树的对象常元 $\\top$ 同时当作元逻辑布尔值。扩充语法展开的经典语义保持另见 [[72-lem-classical-expansion-semantics]]；这是后续性质链接，不是本定义的循环前提。"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-460","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-classical-expansion-semantics|lem-classical-expansion-semantics — 扩充公式到基本语法的语义保持]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-435","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-classical-expansion-semantics]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-classical-expansion-semantics|lem-classical-expansion-semantics — 扩充公式到基本语法的语义保持]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-371","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-lem-classical-expansion-semantics]]"}],"outgoing":["3c073b947b255638","5c014dab66d624c8"]}